# Only gateway-service's build uses the repo root as its build context
# (needed to generate the aggregated OpenAPI snapshot from sibling
# services' source — see gateway-service/Dockerfile). The other 4
# services each build from their own directory and never see this file.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
*.md
